// A quiet reunion. Voice mappings are left to the chosen provider.
narrator: 末班车开走以后，站台上只剩下两个人。 [pause 400ms]
lin: [act "trying to sound casual"|我还以为你不来了。]
chen: [act "out of breath, but relieved"|差一点。] [pause 300ms] 还好，你还在。
lin: [whisper|我答应过等你。] [pause 500ms] 走吧，回家。
